                                  <span className="text-[10px] font-black text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest animate-pulse">🏛️ กำลังยื่นขอจดทะเบียนพาณิชย์อิเล็กทรอนิกส์ กรมพัฒนาธุรกิจการค้า</span>
                                  <span className="text-[10px] text-amber-500 font-bold">{tradeRegisterProgress}%</span>
                               </div>
                               <div className="w-full bg-neutral-950 border border-amber-500/10 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                  <div className="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-yellow-400 h-full transition-all duration-300" style={{ width: `${tradeRegisterProgress}%` }} />
                               </div>
                               <div className="text-[9px] text-amber-400/80 space-y-1.5 max-h-[110px] overflow-auto pt-2 border-t border-amber-500/10">
